<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">n1.The above results were reviewed by the Audit Committee, approved  and  taken on record by the Board at its meeting held on 14th February 2019 and were subjected to Limited Review by the Statutory Auditors of the Company, in terms of Regulation 33 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulation, 2015.  n  n2.No production and related activities were carried out during the period.  n  n3. The settlements implemented during the quarter with the surplus workers/executives  have been expensed.  n  n4. No Interest has been provided on the facilities availed from financial institutions during the period under review. Interest as per the Settlement Agreement will be expensed when it is paid.  n  n5.The Company has identified its Chennai Unit under Ind AS 105 and accordingly adjustments are shown separately in the statement of profit and loss.  n  n6.Revenue from operations for the period upto 30th June 2017 include Excise Duty on goods sold. With the implementation of Goods and Service Tax (GST) in India with effect from 1st July 2017, Excise Duty has subsumed into GST and hence revenue from operations for the  period from 1st July 2017 does not include Excise Duty.  n  n7. Earlier provision of Income Tax withdrawn.  n  n8. The Board in its meeting on 29th Nov. 2018 decided to close the Factory at Porur, Chennai with effect from close of business hours on 29th Nov. 2018 , arising from the continuing suspension of production and settlement of the workforce.  n  n9. Figures have been regrouped/reclassified wherever necessary, to conform to this period's classifications. </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
